# Project Architecture

Read root `AGENTS.md` first. It is the full rulebook.

## Hard constraints

- Modular monolith: `frontend/`, `backend/`, `worker/`, `shared/`
- Stack fixed: Next.js + NestJS + Prisma + PostgreSQL + Redis + BullMQ + Cloudinary
- Flow: Controller → Service → Repository → Prisma
- No microservices / GraphQL / alternate ORM / v1 payments without approval
- 7-day dynamic trial; API omits answers/explanations when not entitled
- Questions require auth; question CRUD admin-only
- Auth: HTTP-only cookies + CSRF; never localStorage tokens
- Secrets only in `.env` (gitignored); commit `.env.example` only
- Prefer clean, maintainable TypeScript; no unnecessary deps or abstractions

Unclear product rules → `docs/19-decisions-and-assumptions.md` (`NEEDS APPROVAL`).
